      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "# Template configuration\n\n**Set project_key** holds the hardcoded deployment key.\n**Get Project Config** provides project values (zendesk_domain, payments_api_base_url, status IDs, macros, slack channel).\n\nSubworkflow refs (HMAC, Update Zendesk) remain inline; rewire to template versions per project.\n\n## To duplicate for a new project\n- Duplicate this workflow.\n- Change the value in **Set project_key**.\n- Re-bind Zendesk/Slack credentials and subworkflow IDs.",
